  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>About our brand and products.</strong> CloudPaws is a premium Australian pet wellness brand for modern owners who treat their dogs as family. Our catalogue includes The Co-Pilot 2-in-1 dog travel seat and carrier, orthopedic stairs and ramps, orthopedic beds, anxiety mats and premium hair removers — elevated comfort for your best friend.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What makes us different.</strong> We blend luxurious home aesthetics with clinical-grade function. Visible safety anchoring, orthopedic foam support, machine-washable covers, and small-breed-friendly sizing — all wrapped in design you're proud to have in your home, built for Australian conditions and right-hand-drive cars.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How affiliates can earn.</strong> 20% commission on every qualifying sale, a generous 60-day cookie window, high average order values, recurring earnings from repeat buyers, reliable monthly payouts, and a real-time tracking dashboard.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How to promote us.</strong> Lead with empathy. Show safety storytelling, senior-dog mobility, travel lifestyle, and anxiety relief across Reels, TikTok, YouTube, Pinterest and blogs. Keep it warm and sophisticated, never gimmicky or aggressively discount-driven.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information.</strong> Open worldwide, manual approval within 3–5 business days. Disclose per ACCC/FTC rules. No trademark bidding, no fabricated codes. Commissions paid on net sales after the 30-day return window. Questions? The affiliate team replies to every email. Email us at support@cloudpaws.com</p></div></div>",
